# Runtime logs at the repository root only. Do not ignore Rust source modules named `logs`.
/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

